//! Call and method call type checking for the TML self-hosting type checker.
//!
//! Implements function call resolution, method dispatch, generic instantiation,
//! and operator desugaring (a + b → Add::add(a, b)).
//!
//! ## Call Resolution Order (mirrors C++ `check_call`)
//!
//! 1. Polymorphic builtins (print, println)
//! 2. Compiler intrinsics (type_id, size_of, align_of, type_name)
//! 3. Named function lookup with overload resolution
//! 4. Enum constructor lookup
//! 5. Static method calls on types (Type::method)
//! 6. Generic function instantiation
//!
//! ## Method Resolution Order (mirrors C++ `check_method_call`)
//!
//! 1. Primitive type builtin methods (to_string, len, etc.)
//! 2. Named type methods (struct/enum impl methods)
//! 3. Behavior method lookup (for types implementing behaviors)
//!
//! Phase 14c — items 3.1–3.5.

